        "Title": "HOW TO USE  -  Run before every issue.  The model is only READ, never changed.\nA report <project>_QA_<date>.xlsx is written next to the .rvt: SUMMARY with OK / CHECK per item + one tab per check with the element IDs.\nFind an element: Manage > Select by ID > paste the ID.  Checks: warnings, rooms, views not on sheets, sheets, CAD imports, links, in-place families, groups, purgeable, levels.",
